# A clear area for trying both portal types (about six seconds long).
# These full-height gates catch the player anywhere between the floor and screen top.
# The first gate selects Cube regardless of the startingMode setting in main.cpp.
# Watch the mode label; hold Space/Up to feel the change between jumping and flying.
# Used gates turn gray. R or death restores their original colors and startingMode.

portal_cube 8 0 1 3
portal_ship 20 0 1 3
portal_cube 52 0 1 3

# No obstacles: focus on the controls. Finish twelve cells after the final gate.
